    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT AGAINST WAVES OF ZOMBIES, MONSTERS AND DEMON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of ranged and melee weapons to defend yourself against waves of different enemy types at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE YOUR TEAMMATES, STRUCTURES AND ITEMS TO WIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, structures, teammates and items correctly to gain an advantage through synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE THE RIGHT DECISIONS AT DAYTIME TO SURVIVE THE NIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay loop alternates between day and night. During the day, decisions are made and teammates, structures, weapons or items are purchased. At night, fighting takes place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAND YOUR WAY THROUGH SKILL AND STRATEGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some waves are boss waves, where you face enemies with the character of a final boss. A good strategy during the day and skill at night will be required to defeat these powerful enemies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT AGAINST WAVES OF ZOMBIES, MONSTERS AND DEMON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/f0d7ef14a5de84b2ee5ada73d7c25a6b.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of ranged and melee weapons to defend yourself against waves of different enemy types at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE YOUR TEAMMATES, STRUCTURES AND ITEMS TO WIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/30ff9256521c934bae5fa4a09fbf8bf1.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, structures, teammates and items correctly to gain an advantage through synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE THE RIGHT DECISIONS AT DAYTIME TO SURVIVE THE NIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/ab88cc02c55de1ef147ea772ebbae143.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay loop alternates between day and night. During the day, decisions are made and teammates, structures, weapons or items are purchased. At night, fighting takes place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAND YOUR WAY THROUGH SKILL AND STRATEGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.poster.avif?t=1736957823\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.webm?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395840/extras/5825e19badcc9c083d561cf849d10001.mp4?t=1736957823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some waves are boss waves, where you face enemies with the character of a final boss. A good strategy during the day and skill at night will be required to defeat these powerful enemies.</p>",
